<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4949 per dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4949 per dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4949 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.4001 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     June 24		 June 23</p>
<p> High			     75.4999		 75.5350</p>
<p> Low				75.4000		 75.4001</p>
<p> Open			     75.4000		 75.4500</p>
<p> Close			    75.4949		 75.4001</p>
<p> Volume ($ mln)		  1.220		   0.855</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
